<div class="one_half"><span class="section1_it">The Leader in</span><br />
<span class="section1_large2">Neurology<br />
Proteomics <span class="section1_large3">&amp;</span><br />
Genomics</span></p>
<p class="seciton1_small">LAB TESTED. REAL-WORLD PROVEN.</p>
</div>
<div class="one_half last_column">
<img class="wp-image-29 size-full" src="https://evogen.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/Section-1-Layout-MASTER_07.png" alt="section-1-layout-master_07" width="670" height="533" align="bottom" srcset="https://evogen.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/Section-1-Layout-MASTER_07.png 670w, https://evogen.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/Section-1-Layout-MASTER_07-300x239.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px" /></div>
