<p style="text-align: center;">Developing the best-in-class products for Neurology Proteomics &amp; Genomics.</p>
<div class="one_half"><img loading="lazy" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-87" src="https://evogen.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/evoScore_DX.png" alt="evoscore_dx" width="264" height="66" /></p>
